      ":question/problem": "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x+4 \\\\  & x-3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{2}-5x-10\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{2}-9x}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4x-10 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4x-12}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, we conclude the following:\n\n| $3{x}^{2}-5x-10$ | $=$ | {{field-1}} | $+\\,\\,$ | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x-3$ |  | $x-3$ |  |  |  |"
